# Prototype-only Unity project. Version only own scripts, scenes, derived materials and docs.
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
MemoryCaptures/
Recordings/
*.csproj
*.sln
*.user
.vs/
